// Therefore:
// - On positive clock edges: p = a
// - This is efficient for Q circuit.
// - Q (p) will toggle based on negative clock edge.

// To detect a negative clock edge, we can use:
// on positive edge: Q toggles on negative edge.
// So we need to invert the clock at the D input for negative clock behavior.

// So for Q (neg):
// Clock goes negative: Q toggle = Q flips based on D.

